@startuml
title ATM Control - Withdrawal Process

[*] --> Idle

state Idle
state "Waiting for PIN" as WaitingForPIN
state "Validating PIN" as ValidatingPIN
state "Withdrawal Options" as WithdrawalOptions
state "Custom Amount Entry" as CustomAmountEntry
state "Transaction Approved" as TransactionApproved
state "Transaction Rejected" as TransactionRejected
state Confiscating
state Ejecting

Idle --> WaitingForPIN : Card Inserted / Get PIN

WaitingForPIN --> ValidatingPIN : PIN Entered / Validate PIN
ValidatingPIN --> WaitingForPIN : Invalid PIN / Invalid PIN Prompt
ValidatingPIN --> WithdrawalOptions : Correct PIN / Show Options

WithdrawalOptions --> CustomAmountEntry : [Enter custom amount]
CustomAmountEntry --> TransactionApproved : [Approve transaction] | --> TransactionRejected : [Reject transaction]

TransactionApproved --> Ejecting : Dispense Cash, Print Receipt, Return Card
TransactionRejected --> Confiscating : Keep Card for Security Reasons
Confiscating --> Ejecting : Return Card

WaitingForPIN --> Confiscating : Cancel Process / Keep Card
CustomAmountEntry --> Confiscating : Cancel Process / Keep Card

TransactionRejected --> [*] : Stop Transaction and Return Card

ValidatingPIN --> [*] : Cancel Process / Keep Card

@enduml
